hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1858","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mutim se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere paanch naam hain, main Muhammad hun aur main Ahmad hun aur main Mahi hun jis ke zariye Allah kufr ko mitata hai, aur main Hashir hun jis ke qadmon par log jama kiye jain ge, aur main Aqib hun."
